<title>JAPAN: Indonesia June Minas calculated at $17.77/bbl.</title>
<headline>Indonesia June Minas calculated at $17.77/bbl.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of Indonesia's main Minas crude oil for June lifting has been calculated at $17.77 per barrel, down $1 from May, traders said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Prices of other grades are as follows:</p>
<p>    TYPE		  JUNE	     MAY</p>
<p> Ardjuna		  18.39	    19.28</p>
<p> Arun Condensate	18.48	    19.34</p>
<p> Attaka		   19.09	    19.96</p>
<p> Cinta		    17.03	    17.99</p>
<p> Duri		     16.33	    16.95</p>
<p> Handil		   17.77	    18.77</p>
<p> Lalang		   17.82	    18.82</p>
<p> Widuri		   16.90	    17.88</p>
<p> Belida		   18.97	    19.93</p>
<p> Anoa		     19.49	    20.36</p>
<p> Badak		    19.09	    19.96</p>
<p> Bekapai		  19.09	    19.96</p>
<p> Bunyu		    17.47	    18.47</p>
<p> Jatibarang	     16.76	    17.76</p>
<p> Bontang Mix	    18.28	    19.14</p>
<p> Walio		    17.57	    18.57</p>
